{"reviewId": "437747423_87v88XF9v", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "根据2026年政府工作报告，今年的核心基调是“稳中求进、以进促稳”，重点围绕“新质生产力”和“扩大内需”两大主线展开。结合政策红利，以下行业及对应的上市公司值得重点关注：\n 核心政策红利提炼\n新质生产力（科技主线）：重点打造集成电路、航空航天、生物医药、低空经济为新兴支柱产业；培育量子科技、具身智能、脑机接口、6G等未来产业。\n\n扩大内需（消费主线）：安排超长期特别国债支持消费品以旧换新；释放文旅、赛事、康养消费潜力。\n\n新基建与安全：实施超大规模智算集群工程；加快发展卫星互联网；打造“5G+工业互联网”升级版。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "2016年至2018年的世界大宗商品价格波动做了预测，相信这是未来三年最重要的机会了。", "range": "1429-1472", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "437747423_87v88XF9v", "userVid": 437747423, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773140416, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 437747423, "name": "是小九呀", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/FMajU52WvbHc6nFyH70TakhzjgbWV2YOXibUCJNACP3btHtGotBaFK8j4dicsm8O78vjh1keibwYOA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "是小九呀", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "与有肝胆人共事，从无字句处读书", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 51, "likes": [{"userVid": 225365465, "name": "ZPP🐰", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0024-ZL1ztHmJmvSUFRhFxwU2t98/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 9, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "有我懂的，以旧换新，百亿补贴😁", "reviewId